# The log of the test must have a line for each of these patterns (grep -E).
# The player stands on the floor in front of the stairs, with the feet at z = -143.
\[3\.00\].* loc=\(1900 93 -99\) .* CollisionHeight=43\.000000 BaseEyeHeight=40\.000000
# The crouch makes the player 16 units high, and the feet stay on the floor. Before the fix the crouch failed here,
# and the player stayed 43 units high with the feet 27 units down in the floor.
\[4\.00\].* loc=\(1900 93 -126\) .* CollisionHeight=16\.000000 BaseEyeHeight=13\.000000 .* bIsCrouching=True
# The crouch walk goes up the stairs to the top floor, where the feet are at z = 129.
\[12\.00\].* loc=\(26[0-9]{2} 93 146\) .* CollisionHeight=16\.000000
# The player stands up at the top.
\[13\.00\].* loc=\(26[0-9]{2} 93 173\) .* CollisionHeight=43\.000000 BaseEyeHeight=40\.000000 .* bIsCrouching=False
# The eye of the player never goes below the center of the player. Before the fix it went 235 units below it at the
# first step, and the camera showed the space under the floor.
!Harness: dump JCDentonMale0 .* EyeHeight=-
